    {
      "text": "Forest plot, panel b, of 7 studies (Chipinduro 2017 to Orikiriza 2021) giving TP, FP, FN, TN, sensitivity and specificity (95% CI), with black squares and CI lines on 0–1 scales and a summary diamond. Sensitivity ranges from 0.00 to 1.00 and specificity from 0.79 to 1.00; the summary estimate is sensitivity 0.16 (0.08–0.31) and specificity 0.95 (0.90–0.98).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
